{'symbol': 'ROP', 'date': '2022-02-11 16:21:00', 'title': 'DAT EXPANDS DIGITAL FREIGHT MATCH PARTNERSHIP WITH PARADE', 'text': "PORTLAND, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #FREIGHT--DAT FREIGHT & ANALYTICS ANNOUNCED AN EXPANDED PARTNERSHIP WITH PARADE THROUGH A MINORITY INVESTMENT THAT WILL ENABLE A DEEPER INTEGRATION BETWEEN PARADE AND NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST FREIGHT MARKETPLACE. THE EXPANDED PARTNERSHIP WILL BUILD ON AN EXISTING AGREEMENT TO ENABLE MUTUAL BROKER CUSTOMERS TO SELECT AND PRICE LOADS ON DAT'S LOAD BOARD USING PARADE'S ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE. PARADE'S ADOPTION OF DAT FOR EXTERNAL TRUCK CAPACITY WILL PROVIDE MUTUAL BROKER"}